<title>GERMANY: Sixt capital increase probable in 1997.</title>
<headline>Sixt capital increase probable in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car rental company Sixt AG said on Friday that it would probably raise fresh capital in 1997.</p>
<p>Sixt Chairman Erich Sixt said at the company's shareholder meeting that the capital increase could come soon, but declined to be more specific, saying it would depend on market conditions.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
